Boost.Context for arm64_32 (watchOS): the arm64 Mach-O assembly with 32-bit pointers. arm64_32 passes
and returns transfer_t, two 32-bit pointers, packed in X0 (as clang does for any such struct), and
pointers arrive in W registers; the context switch itself is the arm64 one. The 32-bit ARM Mach-O
assembly it replaces in the Jamfile was for armv7 and armv7k, which Xcode no longer builds for.

